		{
			"name": "Zoned In on Zero",
			"tag": "Enhance",
			"type": "Talent",
			"description": "When **Astra Yao** is in the team:\nAfter Ellen uses her Ultimate, it dispels **Astra Yao**'s **Crowd Control debuffs**, and she automatically uses \"Ice Sea Diving\" 1 time, then immediately triggers **Astra Yao**'s \"Minuet Pianissimo,\" and grants **Astra Yao** 1 **extra turn** that can be used to insert an Ultimate.\nAfter **Astra Yao** uses her Ultimate, it dispels **Ellen**'s **Crowd Control debuffs**, and she automatically uses \"Cadenza Cascade\" 1 time, and immediately triggers Ellen's \"Saw Teeth Trimming.\" This instance of \"Saw Teeth Trimming\" grants Ellen 1 \"Shark's Gotta Bite,\" and after this attack ends, triggers Ellen's \"Ice Sea Diving\" 1 more time.\nWhen attacks triggered by \"Zoned In on Zero\" select a primary target, they prioritize enemy targets afflicted with the \"Bite Mark\" state.\nBasic ATKs triggered by \"Zoned In on Zero\" do not recover Skill Points, \"Ice Sea Diving\" triggered by \"Zoned In on Zero\" does not consume \"Shark's Gotta Bite.\" Additionally deals Ice DMG equal to ****1[i]%**** of Ellen's ATK to one random enemy, prioritizing the primary target of this use of \"Ice Sea Diving\" and its adjacent targets, bouncing **2[i]** time(s) in total.",
